{"schema_version":1,"kind":"key","id":"gk-pilot-seed","revision":1,"exercise_id":"ge-pilot-seed","exercise_revision":1,"passage_sha256":"063a0181cfccc179d4d9359874a4c8319a10e3b44f0d8f0efb0e76b10600f542","answers":[{"blank_id":"b1","canonical_answer":"had gone","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"By the time Nina arrived 给出过去的参照时间。had gone 是 go 的过去完成时，表示她到场前大多数纸袋已不在原处。were gone 也是自然英语，表示她到场时纸袋已经不在的状态，但 were 在这里是系动词，gone 是形容词；题面允许补入助动词、不定式标记或比较级标记，未允许另加系动词，因此本空不计 were gone。","knowledge_tags":["过去完成时","系表结构"]},{"blank_id":"b2","canonical_answer":"to trade","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"in order to 加动词原形表目的，此处说明带豆子来是为了交换。","knowledge_tags":["目的不定式"]},{"blank_id":"b3","canonical_answer":"whose","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"whose 的先行词是 a boy，在定语从句里限定 table；whose table 指那个男孩的桌子。","knowledge_tags":["关系限定词"]},{"blank_id":"b4","canonical_answer":"which","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"inside which 中的 which 指纸袋，后面 was a handwritten message 用倒装语序介绍袋里的便条。","knowledge_tags":["介词加关系代词","倒装"]},{"blank_id":"b5","canonical_answer":"that","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"provided that 表示只要满足某个条件。","knowledge_tags":["条件连词"]},{"blank_id":"b6","canonical_answer":"carefully","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"副词描述放进包里的动作方式。","knowledge_tags":["副词"]},{"blank_id":"b7","canonical_answer":"writing","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"介词 by 后接动名词 writing，说明她用什么方法给花盆做标记。","knowledge_tags":["介词后接动名词","方式状语"]},{"blank_id":"b8","canonical_answer":"taller","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"much 和 than 表明两株植物比较高度。","knowledge_tags":["比较级"]},{"blank_id":"b9","canonical_answer":"to see","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"so as to 加动词原形表目的，说明她为什么把两株植物都留了下来。","knowledge_tags":["目的不定式"]},{"blank_id":"b10","canonical_answer":"to bring","accepted_variants":[],"explanation_zh":"plan 后接不定式表示计划做某事；把新种子带到下一次交换活动回应了便条的要求。","knowledge_tags":["不定式作宾语"]}]}
